/E (Dual-Tiered Enforcement: Applies a fast per-source rate limit \(BPF_MAP_TYPE_HASH\) to isolate single-source volumetric flooders alongside a global rate limit \(BPF_MAP_TYPE_ARRAY\) to shield the server during multi-source distributed floods.)
