/Title (RFC 4732 \(Internet Denial-of-Service Considerations\): Outlines the architectural vulnerabilities of internet protocols to volumetric attacks. It establishes the foundational requirement for mitigation strategies to utilize both per-source and global rate-limiting mechanisms to preserve service availability during query floods.)
